+    through the (misaligned, optionally corrected) ring and plot how the spin
+    vector precesses with s -- via the twiss-based spin transport, not a
+    tracking loop.
+
+    Set apply_misalignment=False if `base_line` is already misaligned (e.g.
+    loaded from a pre-misaligned JSON), so this doesn't stack a second random
+    misalignment on top of it.
